---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import roadmap from '../data/roadmap.json';
import entries from '../data/entries.json';
import entities from '../data/entities.json';
import artwork from '../data/artwork.json';
---
<Site title="About Demonology" description="The Christian mission, research standards and future direction of Demonology.">
<section class="wrap archive methodology"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</p><h1>About Demonology</h1><p class="lead">Exploring the darkness through the light of Scripture.</p><p>Demonology is a Christian research archive grounded in Biblical, Trinitarian theology. We affirm Jesus Christ as Lord and God and study spiritual evil in light of his authority.</p><p>The archive distinguishes explicit Biblical teaching from historical testimony, theological interpretation and extra-Biblical tradition. Its purpose is education and research, not the promotion of occult practices.</p><h2>Current collection</h2><p>{entries.length} research entries, including {entities.length} entity profiles, and {artwork.length} original illustrations. All current studies await final editorial review.</p><p><a href="/research/">Explore research</a> · <a href="/encyclopaedia/">Encyclopaedia</a> · <a href="/media/">Gallery</a> · <a href="/methodology/">Read our methodology</a></p><h2>The next chapters</h2>{roadmap.map(m=><section class="claim"><p class="status">v{m.version} · {m.status}</p><h3>{m.title}</h3><p>{m.description}</p></section>)}</section>
</Site>
